    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle or anything, just one or two pills to get through the night so i can rest. if i just take a small dose of the advil, is the bleeding risk really that big of a deal? i feel like i know my body and it's never been an issue before. i'd rather just take a couple and sleep than be in this much pain.",
